      "comment": "Rostam: Rostam",
      "content": "Rostam, the 'Wolf Pup', was a Knight of Boreas and Arundolyn's deputy in the Knights of Favonius 500 years ago. He created Favonius Bladework and died in the cataclysm after twenty-three years of service.\n\nBorn to a peasant family, he rose through sword and loyalty. He loved the singer Rosalyne, later La Signora, and mentored Roland.",
