    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Rosalyne",
        "Crimson Witch of Flame"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Rostam",
        "Wolf Pup"
      ],
      "comment": "Rostam: Rostam and Rosalyne",
      "content": "Rosalyne-Kruzchka Lohefalter sang in the square in Mondstadt, and the stern knight Rostam loved her. He gave her a Hydro timepiece before she left for the Sumeru Akademiya. She came home to a ruined city and his death, and became the Crimson Witch of Flame, later La Signora.\n\nIn Elegy for the End his last thoughts are that she is abroad and safe. Her song changed after her return into a lament that no wind could bring him back.",
